OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1785304074
OL,3,CFirefighters tackle large fire in
OL,4,CGoring heath
OL,6,FFirefighters from across Oxfordshire
OL,7,Fand Berkshire have been tackling a
OL,8,Fsignificant fire in Goring Heath.
OL,10,FThe fire spread rapidly, engulfing
OL,11,Fcars and agricultural buildings before
OL,12,Fspreading into a nearby tree line and
OL,13,Fsurrounding fields near the Reading
OL,14,Farea.
OL,16,FA total of 14 fire appliances,
OL,17,Fsupported by a number of officers,
OL,18,Fattended the scene to bring the
OL,19,Fincident under control.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/4
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
