PN,38402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1785304074
OL,3,CFirefighters tackle large fire in
OL,4,CGoring heath
OL,6,FFirefighters worked in challenging
OL,7,Fconditions throughout the afternoon,
OL,8,Fto contain the flames and prevent it
OL,9,Ffrom spreading further to nearby
OL,10,Fproperties and land.
OL,12,FThey managed to stop the fire
OL,13,Fspreading and limited its impact on
OL,14,Fthe wider area.
OL,16,FLib Dem councillor Maggie Filipova-
OL,17,FRivers has described the efforts she's
OL,18,Fseen in the local community to support
OL,19,Fone another following the fire.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/4
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
