OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1785304074
OL,3,CFirefighters tackle large fire in
OL,4,CGoring heath
OL,6,FShe said: "Farmers were supporting the
OL,7,Fefforts, community members were
OL,8,Fgetting refreshments to the emergency
OL,9,Fservices and so much gratitude to our
OL,10,Ffire crews.
OL,12,F"It's incredible to think there's
OL,13,Fpeople out there that will go into
OL,14,Fdanger to keep us safe."
OL,16,FResources were scaled back into the
OL,17,Fevening and six fire appliances of
OL,18,Fcrews worked to dampen down hotspots
OL,19,Fand monitor the affected area.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/4
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
