FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1785304074
OL,3,CFirefighters tackle large fire in
OL,4,CGoring heath
OL,6,FTwo fire appliances remain at the
OL,7,Fscene today as a precaution while
OL,8,Fcrews continue to monitor conditions.
OL,10,FLong Toll Road remains closed to
OL,11,Fsupport ongoing operations.
OL,13,FThe cause of the fire is currently
OL,14,Funknown, and a fire investigation is
OL,15,Funderway.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/4
